Subject: Instructors & Helpers Needed for Carpentries R Geospatial Workshop
Message-ID: <8-zbL4cWp6c.-1KxpWFpCAAJ@davis-rug.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/davis-rug/c/8-zbL4cWp6c/m/-1KxpWFpCAAJ>
